  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alumni event STP Water Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 3 online conferences with the theme &quot;Innovative Water Management in the MENA region&quot; contribute to increasing the knowledge of the alumni in the field of Water Management. The knowledge will enable them to (better) guide reforms/developments in the field of water management in their own country (change agent). In addition, the aim of the event is to strengthen the bond with the alumni of the STP training course &apos;Water Management&apos; 2019 (ambassador Netherlands).The Alumni participants are habitants of Iraq, Morocco, Palestinian Territories, Yemen, Sudan, Jordan, Libya and Iran.</narrative>
  </description>
